  "goodToKnow": "Das Endspiel is the final match of a tournament: ins Endspiel kommen (to reach the final). Das Finale is a common synonym. Since 1985, the German cup final (DFB-Pokal-Endspiel) has been played every year in Berlin's Olympiastadion, and fans chant Berlin, Berlin, wir fahren nach Berlin! In chess, das Endspiel is the endgame, and figuratively it's the final phase of something. Plural: die Endspiele."
